letal segmentation and spine formation, via positively regulating late-stage endosomal trafficking in notochord cells (By similarity). Required for normal spatial learning and memory, independent of normal brain development (By similarity). May be required for normal urinary tract and kidney formation (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}